OL,3,CRescuers dig through rubble after
OL,4,CIndonesia earthquake kills at least 51
OL,6,FRescue teams in eastern Indonesia
OL,7,Frecovered four more bodies on Sunday
OL,8,Fafter a 7.7-magnitude earthquake
OL,9,Fstruck the day before, bringing the
OL,10,Fdeath toll to 51.
OL,12,FThousands more people have been
OL,13,Fdisplaced by the quake, which hit
OL,14,FIndonesia's eastern Flores region at a
OL,15,Fdepth of six miles shortly before 6am
OL,16,Flocal time.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
