OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786947487
OL,3,CRescuers dig through rubble after
OL,4,CIndonesia earthquake kills at least 51
OL,6,FResidents fled in panic as tsunami
OL,7,Fwarnings were issued and later lifted.
OL,8,FAt least 235 aftershocks followed,
OL,9,Faccording to Indonesia's
OL,10,Fmeteorological agency.
OL,12,FRescuers on Sunday dug through debris
OL,13,Flooking for people feared buried
OL,14,Fbeneath landslides triggered by the
OL,15,Fquake across six regencies on Flores,
OL,16,Fa predominantly Catholic island in
OL,17,FMuslim-majority Indonesia.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
