OL,3,CRescuers dig through rubble after
OL,4,CIndonesia earthquake kills at least 51
OL,6,FThey focused on three regencies that
OL,7,Fremained inaccessible after the
OL,8,Fearthquake: the hardest-hit Manggarai,
OL,9,FEast Manggarai and Nagekeo.
OL,11,FRescuers in Maumere, the capital of
OL,12,FSikka regency, said they had cleared
OL,13,Fmost landslides and reopened roads
OL,14,Fthat had cut off villages, but warned
OL,15,Fcommunication disruptions and power
OL,16,Foutages are hampering search efforts.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
