OL,3,CRescuers dig through rubble after
OL,4,CIndonesia earthquake kills at least 51
OL,6,FThe National Search and Rescue Agency
OL,7,Fsaid 101 people were injured. More
OL,8,Fthan 900 homes were destroyed and 450
OL,9,Fmore damaged, forcing about 5,000
OL,10,Fpeople into temporary shelters.
OL,12,FThousands at Labuan Bajo, the gateway
OL,13,Fto Komodo National Park, one of
OL,14,FIndonesia's best-known tourist
OL,15,Fdestinations, spent the night
OL,16,Foutdoors, fearing strong aftershocks.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
