OL,3,CRescuers dig through rubble after
OL,4,CIndonesia earthquake kills at least 51
OL,6,F"The shaking was terrifying, so
OL,7,Fintense that my house nearly
OL,8,Fcollapsed," said Anastasia Imad, a
OL,9,Ffarmer, speaking from a makeshift
OL,10,Fgreen tent beside her damaged home.
OL,12,F"We feared the aftershocks would bring
OL,13,Fit down on us while we slept."
OL,15,FLandslides blocked sections of the
OL,16,FTrans-Flores Highway, a roughly435-
OL,17,Fmile road linking communities across
OL,18,Fthe mountainous island.
