OL,3,CRescuers dig through rubble after
OL,4,CIndonesia earthquake kills at least 51
OL,6,FMeanwhile, relief workers distributed
OL,7,Frice, ready-to-eat meals, drinking
OL,8,Fwater, blankets and medicine, while
OL,9,Femergency shelters were being set up
OL,10,Ffor displaced residents.
OL,12,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,13,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,14,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,15,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,17,FAuthorities said restoring electricity
OL,18,Fand communications, as well as
OL,19,Fdelivering aid to remote villages
OL,20,Fisolated by landslides, remained among
OL,21,Fthe biggest challenges.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
