OL,3,CRescuers dig through rubble after
OL,4,CIndonesia earthquake kills at least 51
OL,6,FIndonesia, an archipelago of more than
OL,7,F17,000 islands, is prone to
OL,8,Fearthquakes and volcanic eruptions
OL,9,Fbecause of its location on the Pacific
OL,10,F"Ring of Fire," a horseshoe-shaped arc
OL,11,Fof seismic faults and volcanoes.
OL,13,FFlores has experienced some of the
OL,14,Fcountry's deadliest disasters. A
OL,15,Fpowerful earthquake and tsunami in
OL,16,F1992 killed about 2,500 people on the
OL,17,Fisland.
