OL,3,CRescuers dig through rubble after
OL,4,CIndonesia earthquake kills at least 51
OL,6,FIn 2018, a magnitude 7.5 earthquake
OL,7,Ftriggered a tsunami on Sulawesi that
OL,8,Fkilled more than 4,400 people. In
OL,9,F2004, a magnitude 9.1 quake off
OL,10,FSumatra unleashed a tsunami that
OL,11,Fkilled about 230,000 people in a dozen
OL,12,Fcountries.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/8
